sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant Client as 🖥️ Next.js Client (3000)
    participant Auth as 🔐 Auth Server (8081)
    participant Resource as 🗄️ Resource Server (8082)

    User->>Client: ① /login ページを開く
    Client->>Auth: ② 認可リクエスト (authorize?client_id=...&code_challenge=...)
    Auth->>User: ログインフォーム表示
    User->>Auth: user/password入力
    Auth-->>Client: リダイレクト (callback?code=abc&state=xyz)
    Client->>Auth: ③ /oauth2/token (code + code_verifier)
    Auth-->>Client: access_token / id_token
    Client->>User: "ログイン成功"

    Note over Client,Resource: ↓ ユーザーがサンプルページを操作

    Client->>Resource: /public (GET)
    Resource-->>Client: "This is a public endpoint."

    Client->>Resource: /private (GET, no token)
    Resource-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized

    Client->>Resource: /private (GET, Bearer access_token)
    Resource-->>Client: "Hello, user! You accessed a protected resource."
